{"id":"wb-7-1580","name":"郑山、刘嘴摩崖造像","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"郑山、刘嘴摩崖造像","text":"郑山、刘嘴摩崖造像，位于四川省眉山市丹棱县中隆乡，在郑山和刘嘴的大石包之上，雕刻着一龛龛的唐代佛像。当地人习惯称之为大石包造像。因两地相距较近，因此统称为郑山刘嘴摩崖造像。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%83%91%E5%B1%B1%E3%80%81%E5%88%98%E5%98%B4%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F","revisionId":86590210,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86590210","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/82e14d51ae8c9a846e61e375.jpg","title":"郑山摩崖造像照片.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%83%91%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/%E9%83%91%E5%B1%B1%E6%91%A9%E5%B4%96%E9%80%A0%E5%83%8F%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Cliff Sculpture at Zhengshan (郑山) village","width":320,"height":213}}